{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 32,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 155.135,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.322,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, behold, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "32:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.502,
      "end": 5.567,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I suppose that ye ponder somewhat in your hearts",
      "verse": "32:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.747,
      "end": 10.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning that which ye should do after ye have entered in by the way.",
      "verse": "32:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.292,
      "end": 13.682,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But, behold, why do ye ponder these things in your hearts?",
      "verse": "32:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 14.362,
      "end": 16.638,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do ye not remember that I said unto you",
      "verse": "32:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 16.818,
      "end": 19.79,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that after ye had received the Holy Ghost",
      "verse": "32:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 19.97,
      "end": 22.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye could speak with the tongue of angels?",
      "verse": "32:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 22.379,
      "end": 25.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, how could ye speak with the tongue of angels",
      "verse": "32:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 25.856,
      "end": 28.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were by the Holy Ghost?",
      "verse": "32:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 28.904,
      "end": 31.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Angels speak by the power of the Holy Ghost;",
      "verse": "32:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 31.917,
      "end": 34.564,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they speak the words of Christ.",
      "verse": "32:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 34.744,
      "end": 36.602,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I said unto you,",
      "verse": "32:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 36.782,
      "end": 39.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "feast upon the words of Christ;",
      "verse": "32:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 39.33,
      "end": 43.231,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, the words of Christ will tell you all things what ye should do.",
      "verse": "32:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 43.911,
      "end": 46.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, now after I have spoken these words,",
      "verse": "32:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 46.877,
      "end": 48.735,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if ye cannot understand them",
      "verse": "32:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 48.915,
      "end": 51.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it will be because ye ask not,",
      "verse": "32:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 51.417,
      "end": 52.903,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither do ye knock;",
      "verse": "32:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 53.083,
      "end": 56.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, ye are not brought into the light,",
      "verse": "32:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 56.421,
      "end": 58.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but must perish in the dark.",
      "verse": "32:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 58.866,
      "end": 61.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, again I say unto you",
      "verse": "32:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 61.461,
      "end": 63.922,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if ye will enter in by the way,",
      "verse": "32:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 64.102,
      "end": 66.145,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and receive the Holy Ghost,",
      "verse": "32:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 66.325,
      "end": 69.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it will show unto you all things what ye should do.",
      "verse": "32:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 70.024,
      "end": 72.3,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, this is the doctrine of Christ,",
      "verse": "32:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 72.48,
      "end": 75.127,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there will be no more doctrine given",
      "verse": "32:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 75.307,
      "end": 79.022,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until after he shall manifest himself unto you in the flesh.",
      "verse": "32:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 79.202,
      "end": 83.149,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when he shall manifest himself unto you in the flesh,",
      "verse": "32:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 83.329,
      "end": 87.369,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the things which he shall say unto you shall ye observe to do.",
      "verse": "32:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 88.049,
      "end": 90.371,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Nephi, cannot say more;",
      "verse": "32:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 90.551,
      "end": 93.059,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Spirit stoppeth mine utterance,",
      "verse": "32:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 93.239,
      "end": 101.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I am left to mourn because of the unbelief, and the wickedness, and the ignorance, and the stiffneckedness of men;",
      "verse": "32:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 101.267,
      "end": 103.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they will not search knowledge,",
      "verse": "32:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 103.769,
      "end": 105.952,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor understand great knowledge,",
      "verse": "32:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 106.132,
      "end": 108.779,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when it is given unto them in plainness,",
      "verse": "32:7",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 108.959,
      "end": 110.909,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as plain as word can be.",
      "verse": "32:7",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 111.589,
      "end": 113.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "32:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 113.812,
      "end": 116.97,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I perceive that ye ponder still in your hearts;",
      "verse": "32:8",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 117.15,
      "end": 120.679,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it grieveth me that I must speak concerning this thing.",
      "verse": "32:8",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 120.859,
      "end": 123.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For if ye would hearken unto the Spirit",
      "verse": "32:8",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 123.547,
      "end": 125.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which teacheth a man to pray,",
      "verse": "32:8",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 125.724,
      "end": 127.814,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye would know that ye must pray;",
      "verse": "32:8",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 127.994,
      "end": 130.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the evil spirit teacheth not a man to pray,",
      "verse": "32:8",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 131.053,
      "end": 133.189,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but teacheth him that he must not pray.",
      "verse": "32:8",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 133.869,
      "end": 135.773,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I say unto you",
      "verse": "32:9",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 135.953,
      "end": 137.811,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye must pray always,",
      "verse": "32:9",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 137.991,
      "end": 139.338,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and not faint;",
      "verse": "32:9",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 139.518,
      "end": 142.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye must not perform any thing unto the Lord",
      "verse": "32:9",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 142.809,
      "end": 150.518,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save in the first place ye shall pray unto the Father in the name of Christ, that he will consecrate thy performance unto thee,",
      "verse": "32:9",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 150.698,
      "end": 154.46,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thy performance may be for the welfare of thy soul.",
      "verse": "32:9",
      "lineIndex": 52
    }
  ]
}